@startuml autonomous-service-operations-boundary
title Autonomous Service vs Autonomous Operations Boundary
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0

class "Autonomous Operations" as aops
class "Autonomous Service" as autosvc

aops --> autosvc : supports

note right of aops
  Independent progression
  of ongoing operational activity
end note

note right of autosvc
  Service-level autonomous
  realization
end note

note bottom
  Autonomous Operations do NOT
  make every Service autonomous
  per ADR-ES-015 §12
  per ASVC-AUTO-NEG-004
  per ASVC-AUTO-NEG-013
end note
@enduml
